    "summaries": [
      {
        "action_date": "2025-02-05",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Specialist Joey Lenz Act of 2025</strong></p><p>This bill requires the Department of Defense (DOD) to ensure that periodic health assessments of members of the Armed Forces include specified elements. DOD must ensure that annual assessments include a sports physical, an&nbsp;electrocardiogram, and specified blood work. Other periodic assessments must include certain testing related to burn pit exposure,&nbsp;perfluoroalkyl and polyfluoroalkyl substances (PFAS) exposure, and other tests or evaluations determined to be appropriate by DOD.</p>",
        "update_date": "2025-04-30T14:50:17Z"
      }
    ]
